  "_howToEdit": [
    "This file is the source of truth for builds. Any chat can edit it; the runner page reads it directly.",
    "Substat and main-stat keys use arabwuwa's own vocabulary:",
    "  hp flatAtk def hpPct atkPct defPct critRate critDmg energyRegen healingBonus",
    "  basicDmg heavyDmg skillDmg libDmg introDmg outroDmg echoDmg attrDmg",
    "  elemDmg:fusion | elemDmg:glacio | elemDmg:electro | elemDmg:aero | elemDmg:spectro | elemDmg:havoc",
    "'level' must be one of 1,10,20,30,40,50,60,70,80,90 (the tiers the reference data ships).",
    "Echo main/secondary values are auto-derived from cost for a 5-star +25 echo. Override with",
    "  'mainValue' and 'secondary' when an echo is unleveled.",
    "baseScale < 1 means the character is at that level PRE-ascension. Solve it as",
    "  (in-game base DEF) / (reference base DEF); it must also reconcile against HP.",
    "weapon.atkOverride / weapon.subOverride give the weapon's REAL values at its actual level.",
    "  Without them the model uses the Lv90 numbers, like arabwuwa does.",
    "Set accountAccurate:true only once the panel check passes; the page greys the badge otherwise.",
    "Buffs live on whoever provides them. target:'team' reaches everyone, target:'self' only the owner.",
    "  panel:true means the buff is already baked into the in-game character panel reading.",
    "  default:true means rotations should normally switch it on."
  ],

